  "title": "Comparison of T2D causal gene predictions",
  "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"card-body temporary-card\">\r\n<div data-v-60aefb42=\"\">\r\n<p class=\"doc content\" id=\"egls.header.info\">The T2D Effector Prediction Summary integrates the results of three methods for prediction of type 2 diabetes effectors:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li class=\"doc content\">the <a href=\"/research.html?pageid=mccarthy_t2d_247\">Curated T2D effector gene predictions</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doc content\">the <a href=\"/research.html?pageid=richards_t2d_266\">Effector index predictions</a> (EIP in the table below)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doc content\">the <a href=\"/research.html?pageid=manningexp_t2d_245\">Integrated Classifier predictions</a> (ICP in the table below).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"doc content\">Note that the top genes predicted by the curated approach may have been used as positive controls or training sets for the other two methods and thus may not appear in those results.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n",
