  "dataTableLegendHtml": "<p>In the plot, each dot represents a gene, plotted by top score (y-axis) vs. chromosomal location (y-axis). Mouse over a dot to see the gene name, coordinates, and scores in each of the methods. Click the <strong>Research Method</strong> tab for more information about how the three lists were compared.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Use the filters above the plot to filter both the plot and the table:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Enter a full or partial gene name in the <strong>Gene</strong> filter and hit 'Return'</li>\r\n\t<li>Enter a score from 1 (weakest evidence) to 5 (strongest evidence) to filter the combined results or the results from individual methods by score.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Click on a column header to sort the table by that column. Click the \"Evidence\" button to view detailed predictions for a gene.</p>\r\n",
